      "source": "claude",
      "type": "bug_draft",
      "storyId": 214,
      "title": "MAC1 - POS Dashboard | Add a Store filter to the Inventory tab and the Overview inventory card",
      "notes": "Agreed with the business 23/11. Counts and Stock Value today cover all branch stores (InvStoreBranch) together and count an item once per category, so an item can show in two categories and the stores behind a figure are not visible. All-branch stores (IsApplyToAllBranch) are not included, which differs from the developer rule. Request: Store filter, default All branch stores. Evidence G-T10, G-T12 (General-Queries).",
